----------------------------------------------------------------
Other readers (.fm2 / .bk2 / .fcm / .gmv / .m64 / .smv)
----------------------------------------------------------------

These six readers' file-header comments cite ONLY the TASVideos
wiki or vendor documentation pages. They were written from public
format specifications and to our knowledge do not draw on any GPL
emulator source. They are still covered by replayr's package-wide
GPL (>= 2) license.
